<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 66,662.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 66,662.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Oct 23 totaled 66,662 bales, up from 64,573 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 2,336 bales issued, no decertification orders, 247 cancellations, and 4,965 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
